{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1297597-i-ve-started-an-exalted-game-help-part-5-social-encounter-design","id":1297597,"title":"I've Started an Exalted Game, Help! Part 5 - Social Encounter Design","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-03-17T15:52:28-07:00","id":1297597,"title":"I've Started an Exalted Game, Help! Part 5 - Social Encounter Design","content":"Can't grasp nature of intimacies in Exalted? Are you struggling to set up a social scene in Exalted be it from a rowdy bar to a fancy gala? Unsure of how to gauge the powers and effects of some of the more powerful social charms? Prepare to have all of these questions answered and more in this next handy dandy video with no down payment! Don't wait!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kyq81bLjBxg\" target=\"_blank\"> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kyq81bLjBxg\" data-code=\"Kyq81bLjBxg\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/Kyq81bLjBxg/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></a><br /> <br /> <br /> I've also taken some the feedback from the last video. I upped the volume of my voice by a few dB, included timestamps in the video related to its sections (and also several past videos), and decided to ditch the music entirely (Even if I really wanted to throw in Luna Nights/Deus Ex themes).<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> As I mentioned at the end of this video, I feel as if I've accomplished some of the big three core parts of Ex3. I went over the mechanics in detail as well as aspects of combat and social, two of the biggest sections in Ex3. Is there anything particularly else you want to see? Do you want me to delve into talking about the various types of Spirits (Gods, Demons, Ghosts, Elementals) and how they work in the world? Do you want me to discuss directions or specific locations in the game and how to handle them? Do you want me to discuss how to make charms be it individual one off charms, sets of charms from a martial art to evocation, or do you want to torture me and know how to make an entire splat? Or with the big blocks of Storytellers out of the way do you want me to focus on the player side of things? How to make a character for Ex3 from concept to execution? Let me know either below or in the Youtube video.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","name":"Sandact6","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1183_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-18T14:15:52-07:00","id":1297811,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sandact6</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1297597-i-ve-started-an-exalted-game-help-part-5-social-encounter-design#po